## Final publisher checks

- Confirm that Horizon e-Publishing Group authorises this as GST's official
  template and authorises redistribution of both logo files.
- Replace placeholder ISSN, volume, article number and DOI only if fixed values
  are appropriate for a reusable template.
- Upload the ZIP to a new Overleaf project, select pdfLaTeX and compile.
- Submit that same project through **Submit > Overleaf Gallery**. Keep the
